<title>UK: Brent cargo trades at Dec -43 cents - trade.</title>
<headline>Brent cargo trades at Dec -43 cents - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent crude traded at December Brent -43 cents on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is to load in the November 5-7 range and was sold by Glencore to Shell U.K. This was for a maximum sized cargo.</p>
<p>This followed a cargo on Monday at December Brent -6 cents.</p>
</text>
